  "bodyHash": "a3b4d81837c804b6",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:8px\"><strong><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/786/359/logo-tfc-ore-washing.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"760\" height=\"125\"><br><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">======================================================================================</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">採用來自 TFC 已遺忘元素的「溜槽」，打造全新的礦石處理系統。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">現在採得的礦石必須經過加工處理後，才能進行熔煉。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模組引入五階段礦石加工技術：</span><br>- 破碎礦石（獲得碎岩礦塊）<br>-&nbsp;使用溜槽進行第一次沖洗（保留礦塊）<br>-&nbsp;使用磨盤研磨礦塊（獲得髒礦粉）<br>-&nbsp;使用溜槽對髒礦粉進行第二次沖洗（獲得純淨礦粉）<br>-&nbsp;乾淨的礦粉現在可熔鍊為液態金屬<br><br>=======================================================================================<br></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/786/380/multi1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"746\" height=\"407\"></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span><iframe style=\"width:690px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ao-kelimVGw\" width=\"690\" height=\"387\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br>=================================================================================<br></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#ba372a\">=== 此處非常重要 ===</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#e67e23\">建造溜槽需要木材，且從各類礫石中開採時會增加額外掉落物，</span></strong><br><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用「淘金盤」在河流或湖泊中淘洗任何礫石，你將獲得第一批純淨銅粉。<br>請保持耐心，這是一項繁瑣且耗時的活動，但將讓你完成首批金屬鑄造。</span></strong></span><br><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#e67e23\">其餘流程你應該已經了解——你需要製作鋸子和鎬子來獲取第一批木材、<br>木板和原石，以建造加工礦石所需的磨盤。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">整體流程與我們記憶中 TFC 1.7.10 舊版相似。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模組已整合「FirmaLife」與「TFC IE Addon」（礦石與熔煉部分）。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增與「Create」及「Immersive Engineering」模組協作的半自動合成配方。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">已封鎖原礦直接熔煉功能——你必須先進行加工。<br>新增將礦錠熔鍊為液態金屬的配置選項。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:14px\"><strong>此配置旨在盡可能貼近過往設定<br>在整個生產過程中，你最多僅能額外獲得 7% 至 25% 的產出</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模組的設計初衷是讓礦石加工過程更具吸引力，而非單純增加產量</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">=================================================================================</span><br><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/786/381/multi2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"845\" height=\"461\"><br><br><br><br>---------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br>試試其他適用於 TFC 1.20.1 與 1.21.1 的模組<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tfc-debark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/241/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"Debark TFC\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><strong style=\"font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tfc-lumberjack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/251/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a></span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/corals-tfc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/249/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight-tfc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/247/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tfc-more-items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/252/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spindles-tfc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1357/253/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tfc-better-stone-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1361/261/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tfc-metal-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1361/263/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tfc-muskets\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1361/262/logosik-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><br>...</span><br></strong></span></p>",
